# JMicron JMS562 USB->2xSATA bridge 0x152d:0x0562 (SCSI revision 0213) which presents
# a 4TB volume and rejects ATA PASS-THROUGH(16) (INVALID COMMAND OPERATION CODE)
# and (12) (INVALID FIELD IN CDB). '-d sat' must fail without further commands.
# Recorded with smartctl pre-8.0 'smartctl -x -r scsiioctl,4' (complete data).
# The expected output is the replay of this trace. It equals the output of the real
# device except volatile values which changed between both runs.
# converted from "smartctl -r scsiioctl,4" output: jmicron-jms562-0x152d-0x0562_20261022_215537.new-x.ioctl4.txt

# ata pass-through(16)
CDB 85 08 0e 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 ec 00
ALLOC 512
STATUS 2
SENSE 70 00 05 00 00 00 00 0a 00 00 00 00 20 00 00 00 00 00
DATA 
END

# ata pass-through(16)
CDB 85 08 0e 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 a1 00
ALLOC 512
STATUS 2
